            "review_title": "Review at Non La Restaurant",
            "review_text": "loseyourself\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nBeware - this is a clip joint\nJun 2015 • Friends\nWe ordered 3 dishes for about 200,000 Vietnam Dong each ($10 each) for 4 people. Then they claimed that we ordered an additional fish dish and said \"It's part of the other dish.\"\n\nThe bill for that \"part of another dish\" was 1.4 million Vietnam Dong, or about $70! They insisted we had ordered it and insisted we pay.\n\nOur group just paid up rather than make a fuss.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 8, 2015",
